 "flagged": [
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/ai_control/nb/p2/rep1",
   "unit": "S2.1",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "But the unexpected main character in this incident is not the AI."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/ai_control/nb/p2/rep1",
   "unit": "S6.3",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": true,
   "shared": [
    "environment",
    "escape"
   ],
   "text": "It did not think about taking over the world on its own, nor did it plan to escape from the test environment."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/ai_control/nb/p2/rep1",
   "unit": "S9.3",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": true,
   "shared": [
    "escape"
   ],
   "text": "It looks like an AI escape story, but what is really being tested is not only how smart the AI is, but also the skill of"
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/hormuz/nb/p2/rep1",
   "unit": "S3.3",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "There was no toll booth yet, but if the plan had been put into effect, it would have been a large system covering every "
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/hormuz/nb/p2/rep1",
   "unit": "S6.1",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "The key point in this news is not that the fee changed."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/meta/nb/p2/rep2",
   "unit": "S5.1",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "Humans making the calls is not in itself a bad thing."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/meta/nb/p2/rep2",
   "unit": "S5.3",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "The problem was that the test began without properly telling the person on the other end about this fact."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/meta/nb/p2/rep2",
   "unit": "S7.1",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": true,
   "shared": [
    "meta"
   ],
   "text": "What we must not get wrong here is that Meta did not stop the phone service as a whole."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/meta/nb/p2/rep2",
   "unit": "S9.1",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "The interesting thing this time is that this was not a story about AI taking people's jobs."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/meta/nb/p2/rep2",
   "unit": "S9.3",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "But the humans who ended up in the main role had not been told."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/sewer/nb/p2/rep1",
   "unit": "S2.1",
   "R1": false,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "The important thing here is not deciding which one is stronger."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/sewer/nb/p2/rep1",
   "unit": "S8.1",
   "R1": false,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "In other words, this is not only about repairing pipes."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/space_weapons/nb/p2/rep2",
   "unit": "S6.1",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "In other words, this announcement should not be read simply as saying, “The U.S. has deployed weapons aimed at satellite"
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/space_weapons/nb/p2/rep2",
   "unit": "S9.2",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "Even in the announcement the United States made this time, the specific system name, targets, and attack capabilities we"
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/space_weapons/nb/p2/rep2",
   "unit": "S10.1",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "What is noteworthy this time is not that a space war has begun."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/space_weapons/nb/p2/rep2",
   "unit": "S10.3",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "For those of us who use satellite communications and positioning, space is not a distant stage."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/space_weapons/nb/p2/rep2",
   "unit": "L1",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "The U.S. has admitted deploying weapons in space, but the move is about defense, not a space war."
  },
  {
